# claude-docs manifest — drives scripts/claude-docs.sh for this template root.
#
# A Zola static site has three core docs, no optional modules, no agents and no
# SessionStart/format hook (there is no runtime). The only thing the injector
# needs from here is the placeholder pair — this template uses "My Site" /
# "my_site" rather than the MyApp / my_app pair the app templates use.
#
# Format is documented in app-template/claude-docs.manifest.
placeholders|My Site|my_site
